# ── Rust / Soroban ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
target/
# Cargo.lock is excluded for general packages…
Cargo.lock
# …but committed for the contracts workspace so CI builds don't re-resolve
# to incompatible versions of soroban-sdk 26 stack dependencies.
!contracts/Cargo.lock

# Compiled WASM artifacts
*.wasm

